Z||000019||Oreif||04-10-2000||09:13 AM||||I use the Meguire's Deep Crystal Carnuba Wax. When I bought the car the paint was dull but not to bad. I used the Meguire's Deep crystal 3 step set. First I used the  paint cleaner twice, then Polish twice, then finally the wax. Now I just use wax on the whole car. ||||reg||6
